# pipeline-cicd-with-k8s

# CD with kubernetes - Automated Rolling Deployments
A follow-up to the "CD without kubernetes" Project, demonstrating how the pipeline evolves when 
kubernetes takes over container orchestration.

## Stack
- Node.js ( minimal HTTP server app)
- Docker
- Kubernetes( kind_
- github Actions( self-hosted-runner)

## pipeline architecture
1. ** `test` job** (github-hosted runner): syntax validation of the code
2. ** `build-and-push` job** (self-hosted runner): builds the Docker image, tags it with the commit SHA, push it on dockerhun
3. ** `deploy` job** ( self-hosted runner): triggers `kubectl set image` to update the kubernetes deployment with the new image tag

kubernetes then handles the rolling update itsel - replacings pods gradually, with zero downtime

